---
---

<section id="about" class="relative py-28 md:py-36" style="background:#0f0d0a;">
  <div class="max-w-5xl mx-auto px-6 md:px-10">

    <!-- Section label -->
    <div class="reveal text-center mb-14">
      <span class="section-label">About</span>
      <div class="rule-short"></div>
      <h2
        style="font-family:'Cormorant Garamond',serif; font-size:clamp(2rem,4vw,2.75rem); font-weight:400; color:#f5e9cc; letter-spacing:0.04em; margin-top:0.5rem;"
      >
        The Man Behind the Knowing
      </h2>
    </div>

    <div class="grid md:grid-cols-2 gap-16 items-start">

      <!-- Left: pull quote + bio -->
      <div class="space-y-8">
        <blockquote class="pull-quote reveal reveal-delay-1">
          He was told early on that some things are better left unknown.
          He has spent twenty-five years demonstrating why that is excellent
          advice that almost no one takes.
        </blockquote>

        <div class="reveal reveal-delay-2 space-y-5" style="color:#c4b49a; font-size:1.05rem; line-height:1.85;">
          <p>
            Solomon Strauss has spent twenty-five years in the company of secrets.
            A mentalist, storyteller, and occasional inconvenience to those who prefer
            their inner lives kept private, he performs for audiences who appreciate
            the difference between a trick and an experience.
          </p>
          <p>
            He is based in Oklahoma City. He draws on a tradition of storytelling
            that is older than the stage — old tales with the unsettling habit of
            turning out to be about whoever is in the room. He has been asked, more
            than once, whether he is truly reading minds. He has never answered that
            question directly, which he will tell you is itself something of an answer.
          </p>
          <p>
            He came to performance through event coordination — years spent on the
            other side of the evening, making sure everything went according to plan.
            This is perhaps why his performances arrive on time, proceed without
            incident, and leave people with fewer certainties than they arrived with.
            The astonishment, when it comes, is the only surprise anyone is asked
            to accommodate.
          </p>
        </div>
      </div>

      <!-- Right: credentials + photo placeholder -->
      <div class="reveal reveal-delay-1 space-y-8">

        <!-- Photo placeholder — replace src with real photo -->
        <div
          class="relative w-full aspect-[3/4] overflow-hidden"
          style="border: 1px solid rgba(184,146,74,0.2);"
        >
         
          <img
            src="/images/solomon-headshot.jpg"
            alt="Solomon Strauss"
            class="w-full h-full object-cover object-top"
            style="filter: contrast(1.05) sepia(0.15);"
          />
          <!-- Gold corner accents -->
          <span class="absolute top-3 left-3 block w-5 h-5" style="border-top:1px solid rgba(184,146,74,0.5); border-left:1px solid rgba(184,146,74,0.5);"></span>
          <span class="absolute top-3 right-3 block w-5 h-5" style="border-top:1px solid rgba(184,146,74,0.5); border-right:1px solid rgba(184,146,74,0.5);"></span>
          <span class="absolute bottom-3 left-3 block w-5 h-5" style="border-bottom:1px solid rgba(184,146,74,0.5); border-left:1px solid rgba(184,146,74,0.5);"></span>
          <span class="absolute bottom-3 right-3 block w-5 h-5" style="border-bottom:1px solid rgba(184,146,74,0.5); border-right:1px solid rgba(184,146,74,0.5);"></span>
        </div>

        <!-- Credentials -->
        <ul class="space-y-3" style="font-family:'Cormorant Garamond',serif; font-size:1rem; color:#9a8870; letter-spacing:0.05em;">
          <li style="border-bottom:1px solid rgba(184,146,74,0.12); padding-bottom:0.75rem; display:flex; gap:0.75rem;">
            <span style="color:#b8924a;">✦</span>
            Twenty-five years of professional performance
          </li>
          <li style="border-bottom:1px solid rgba(184,146,74,0.12); padding-bottom:0.75rem; display:flex; gap:0.75rem;">
            <span style="color:#b8924a;">✦</span>
            Top-rated on GigSalad · Award-winning performer
          </li>
          <li style="border-bottom:1px solid rgba(184,146,74,0.12); padding-bottom:0.75rem; display:flex; gap:0.75rem;">
            <span style="color:#b8924a;">✦</span>
            Corporate events, private gatherings, theater &amp; stage
          </li>
          <li style="display:flex; gap:0.75rem;">
            <span style="color:#b8924a;">✦</span>
            Oklahoma City · Available nationally
          </li>
        </ul>
      </div>
    </div>
  </div>
</section>
